{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Heartopia, a life simulation game crafted for creativity, freedom, and peace. Build your dream home, explore a wide range of hobbies, and forge warm connections with friends in a town full of endless possibilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Game Features]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 A World of Meaningful Connections</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with the charming residents of Heartopia Town, connect with other players from around the world, and find your lifelong friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras/e2960d608914c2079422b0dcf5eb013c.avif?t=1760059865\" width=1560 height=878 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Indulge Your Every Hobby</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish, cook, garden, or simply watch the birds. In Heartopia, there's no stamina system or daily checklist. Do only what brings you joy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras/abe15f7650f136744eff9f29db95e75a.avif?t=1760059865\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6Build Your Dream House</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you dream of a cozy cottage or a magnificent mansion, Heartopia gives you the tools to turn your vision into a reality. Every brick, flower, and piece of furniture can be customized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras/09952fa33685d42167a95b4fd1aa5957.avif?t=1760059865\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Over 1,000 Daily Outfits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match casual wear, elegant gowns, and whimsical costumes to create the perfect look for any occasion. Express your mood and show the world who you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras/e02a0725ba94ef455d810e54105e7f64.avif?t=1760059865\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 A Seamless Fairy-tale Town</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Walk slowly, take scenic detours, and get lost in its beauty. With no loading screens and no boundaries, the entire fairy-tale town is yours to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras/5c4b27a73cfe225ac36548fa567b36c3.avif?t=1760059865\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4025700?t=1760059865","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4025700?t=1760059865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/42defb2a293424e926fd0a3559e32ba592ce2c66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760059865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/42defb2a293424e926fd0a3559e32ba592ce2c66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760059865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Heartopia, a life simulation game crafted for creativity, freedom, and peace. Build your dream home, explore a wide range of hobbies, and forge warm connec